# /sdd-marketplace

Purpose:
  External skill marketplace interface (Phase 146): list registered sources,
  sync source state, import skills with validation + provenance, and audit
  imported skills for provenance compliance.

Owns: commands/sdd-marketplace.sdd

Description:
  Runtime-backed command (sdd-adapter/commands.ts runMarketplaceCommand).
  Sources live in .sdd/marketplace/registry.json. Imports go through
  SkillValidator (structure/metadata/security gates) and SkillImporter
  (fetch + provenance INDEX.sdd wrapper). Verdicts: SHIP/FIX/BLOCK.

Usage:
  /sdd-marketplace list
  /sdd-marketplace sync <source-id>
  /sdd-marketplace import <source-id> <skill-name> [domain] [group]
  /sdd-marketplace audit

Options:
  list       Show registered sources (active/reference/discovery) + blocked
  sync       Update lastSync for a source; show license rules
  import     Fetch SKILL.md from source repo → validate → import as CANDIDATE
  audit      Validate all imported skills' provenance (SHIP/FIX/BLOCK counts)

Mode: READ_ONLY (list, sync registry timestamps) | READ_WRITE (import, audit writes nothing)

InitialLoad (Phase 151 — EXPAND protocol):
  - .sdd/INDEX.sdd (routing only)
  - .sdd/marketplace/registry.json
  Validator/importer specs and skill wrappers load on EXPAND only.

Runtime:
  Implementation: sdd-adapter/commands.ts → /sdd-marketplace
  Validator: sdd-adapter/skill-validator.ts (structure, license, security gates)
  Importer: sdd-adapter/skill-importer.ts (fetch, wrapper, placement)
  Registry: .sdd/marketplace/registry.json

Lifecycle (Phase 146 §2):
  EXTERNAL → CANDIDATE (import via this command) → ACTIVE (human review [IMP4]) → DEPRECATED

Rules:
  [MKT-01] Imports MUST pass license gate: MIT/Apache-2.0 only; source-available and unlicensed are BLOCKED [IMP6].
  [MKT-02] Imports MUST carry provenance: Source/Origin/Imported/Format/License (CLAUDE.md import rules).
  [MKT-03] Blocked sources (registry.blocked) MUST NOT be importable.
  [MKT-04] Imported skills are CANDIDATES — human review required for ACTIVE [IMP4].
  [MKT-05] New imports SHOULD pass skill-evaluate (governance) before CANDIDATE → ACTIVE [IMP7].
  [MKT-06] Code-bearing imports declare Runtime and run in Docker only [IMP2, R59-R66].
  [MKT-07] Audit findings use SHIP/FIX/BLOCK semantics mapping to PASS/WARN/BLOCK.

Output:
  list:    MARKETPLACE REGISTRY — per source: status, URL, license, format, imported count, lastSync
  sync:    confirmation + license rule echo
  import:  MARKETPLACE IMPORT — skill, source, destination, score, decision, findings
  audit:   MARKETPLACE AUDIT — audited/SHIP/FIX/BLOCK counts + per-skill failures

Navigation:
